<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 05</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 05. PRIVACY NOTICE AND COMMUNICATION CHOICES</b><div>Give the privacy notice required by the Data Protection and Privacy Act, and record choices on who may receive information, by which channel, and on optional clinical photographs. Read with Schedule C of the Service Agreement.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Part A. Privacy notice</h3><p class="t">Who we are. BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED is the data controller for your information.</p><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Personal Data Protection Office registration reference (if applicable)</span><span class="v">{{ v.personal_data_protection_office_registra or prefill.personal_data_protection_office_registra }}</span></td></tr></table><p class="t">What we collect and why. BLOOMWELL uses necessary patient information, including health information (special personal data), for assessment, treatment, coordination, billing, safety and legal recordkeeping, under an appropriate lawful basis. We collect only what is reasonably necessary. Where the patient is a child, information is collected with the consent of a parent or guardian.</p><p class="t">Who may see it. Access is limited to authorised persons. Necessary information may be shared lawfully with treating or receiving professionals, authorised service providers and competent authorities. Paying for care does not automatically entitle a person to clinical information. Particularly sensitive information, such as HIV status, is disclosed only as the law permits.</p><p class="t">Messaging and transfers outside Uganda. Messages on shared phones or accounts may be seen by others, and some messaging platforms store information outside Uganda. BLOOMWELL will explain the privacy risks of the proposed channel and offer a reasonable alternative.</p><p class="t">How long we keep it, and your rights. Records are protected and retained only as justified by applicable clinical and legal requirements. You may request access to or correction of your information, object to processing where the law allows, or raise concerns through BLOOMWELL on {{{ org.phone }}} or the privacy contact {{ org.privacy_email }}, and you may complain to Uganda&#x27;s Personal Data Protection Office.</p><h3>Part B. People permitted to receive updates</h3><table class="g"><thead><tr><th>Recipient and contact</th><th>Information permitted and purpose</th><th>Expiry or limits</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ v.t_r1c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r1c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r1c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r2c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r2c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r2c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r3c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r3c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r3c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r4c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r4c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r4c2 }}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Part C. Communication preferences</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Channel:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == "Telephone" else "☐" }} Telephone</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == "SMS" else "☐" }} SMS</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == "WhatsApp" else "☐" }} WhatsApp</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == "Email" else "☐" }} Email</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == "In person " else "☐" }} In person </span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.channel == " paper" else "☐" }}  paper</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Verified number / email</span><span class="v">{{ v.verified_number_email or prefill.verified_number_email }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Safe time to contact and restrictions</span><span class="v">{{ v.safe_time_to_contact_and_restrictions or prefill.safe_time_to_contact_and_restrictions }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Part D. Optional clinical photographs</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Photographs:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.photographs == "I agree to the specific clinical photographs described below" else "☐" }} I agree to the specific clinical photographs described below</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.photographs == "I decline" else "☐" }} I decline</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Purpose / body area, authorised recipients and storage</span><span class="v">{{ v.purpose_body_area_authorised_recipients_ or prefill.purpose_body_area_authorised_recipients_ }}</span></div><p class="t">Clinical images are restricted to the stated care purpose. No publicity, testimonials, social media or advertising use is authorised by this form. Unselected optional choices mean no permission has been given.</p><h3>Part E. Acknowledgment and recorded choice</h3><p class="t">I received this explanation and made the choices above voluntarily. I may change optional permissions by contacting BLOOMWELL; changes take effect prospectively, subject to lawful processing and retention obligations.</p><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Authority reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.authority_reference or prefill.authority_reference }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Patient or authorised representative</b><div class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.esign else "☐" }} I agree to sign electronically</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.name or patient.name }}<div class="m">Name, capacity / role</div><div>{{ sig.client.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.client.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.client.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.client.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Interpreter or reader (if used)</b></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.name }}<div class="m">Name, address, language</div><div>{{ sig.interpreter.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.interpreter.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.interpreter.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.interpreter.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Witness (recommended)</b></td><td>{{ sig.witness.name }}<div class="m">Name and role</div><div>{{ sig.witness.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.witness.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.witness.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.witness.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.witness.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table></body></html>